Complete local Java example; the app itself does not execute it:
```java
public class Main {
    static int total(int... values) {
        int sum = 0;
        for (int value : values) { sum = sum + value; }
        return sum;
    }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println(total(2, 4, 6));
    }
}

```

